The '''''Interdictor'' line''' was a line of [[Interdictor]] vessels of the [[Galactic Empire]]. The [[Interdictor-class heavy cruiser|''Interdictor''-class heavy cruiser]] was a model of the line, which was an evolution of the [[Immobilizer 418 cruiser]].<ref name="BMF 87" />

